"- Inner Bottle Wall\n    - Attribute 1 Type - smooth, curved inner surface of a glass container\n    - Attribute 2 Color - dark, almost black with subtle amber or coppery reflections along the rim\n    - Attribute 3 Size - circular, with an inner diameter that appears narrow and consistent, surrounded by concentric ridges\n    - Attribute 4 Material - glass\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - transparent glass with slight surface texture and reflective properties\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - one continuous inner wall surface\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - forms the inner boundary of the bottle neck, surrounding the central aperture\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - concentrically aligned, facing inward toward the central aperture\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - seamlessly connected to the glass rim and central aperture, forming a continuous cylindrical interior\n\n- Glass Rim\n    - Attribute 1 Type - circular, raised edge at the opening of the bottle\n    - Attribute 2 Color - dark brown to black with warm amber or coppery highlights from reflected light\n    - Attribute 3 Size - approximately 1-2 cm in width, with a smooth, rounded profile\n    - Attribute 4 Material - glass\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - transparent glass with slight surface texture and reflective properties\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - one continuous rim\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - encircling the outer perimeter of the bottle neck opening\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - horizontal, facing outward from the bottle's interior\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - attached to the inner bottle wall and the bottle neck opening, forming a seamless transition\n\n- Bottle Neck Opening\n    - Attribute 1 Type - circular aperture formed by the convergence of the inner bottle wall and glass rim\n    - Attribute 2 Color - dark, almost black with subtle amber or coppery reflections along the rim\n    - Attribute 3 Size - circular, with a diameter that appears narrow and consistent, surrounded by concentric ridges\n    - Attribute 4 Material - glass\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - transparent glass with slight surface texture and reflective properties\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - one opening\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - located at the center of the bottle neck, surrounded by the glass rim and inner bottle wall\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - vertically aligned, facing outward from the bottle's interior\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - connected to the inner bottle wall and glass rim, forming a continuous cylindrical structure\n\n- Central Aperture\n    - Attribute 1 Type - circular, dark, hollow center of the bottle neck\n    - Attribute 2 Color - deep black, with no visible internal structure or reflection\n    - Attribute 3 Size - circular, with a diameter that appears narrow and consistent, surrounded by concentric ridges\n    - Attribute 4 Material - glass\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - transparent glass with slight surface texture and reflective properties\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - one aperture\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - located at the center of the bottle neck, surrounded by the inner bottle wall and glass rim\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - vertically aligned, facing outward from the bottle's interior\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - connected to the inner bottle wall and glass rim, forming a continuous cylindrical structure"